    {
      "text": "The 2007 Notice of Preparation described an 18-story mixed-use building on a former car dealership site with up to 375 condominiums, about 148,805 sq ft of retail and about 48,960 sq ft of office. Lead agency: City of Milpitas.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2020 Notice of Determination (applicant BDK Capital, LLC) says the city certified an addendum on August 12, 2020 for the 600 Barber Lane Mixed Use Development, which reduced the 2008 EIR project by 3 residential units, 143,305 sq ft of commercial/retail, 36,160 sq ft of office, 859 parking spaces and 142 feet of maximum height.",
