        "SRC-001751"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Adept Urban page describes 600 Barber as 372 units in four buildings with 5,500 sq ft of retail and 12,800 sq ft of office over a shared podium and garage, between Barber Lane and I-880.",
